+| `service` | Phase 5 · M5.5 | planned | [`../30-specs/Workspace.md`](../30-specs/Workspace.md) |
+| `journal` | Phase 5 · core apps | planned | [`../30-specs/Journal.md`](../30-specs/Journal.md) |
